            "text": "{\"task\":{\"created_at\":\"2026-10-27T06:17:00.997327Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-27T06:17:00.997327Z\",\"org_id\":\"01a17bff-2d7b-734e-96f8-550d0ee6dd08\",\"project_id\":\"01a17c00-8648-7130-978e-bb5deaa00a59\",\"id\":\"01a17c01-4743-73ca-ae8b-97d413ab12c4\",\"title\":\"Call the `echo` tool from the declared `hello-mcp` MCP server with the message `hello from the public MCP`. Write the echoed value exactly, with no quotes or additional formatting, to `/workspace/outputs/greeting.txt`. Then run `echo $WALK_MARKER` in…\",\"display_index\":5,\"status\":\"pending\",\"kind\":\"eval\",\"member_id\":\"01a17bff-2d8d-72d9-bfd9-ebc70e73400d\",\"automation_id\":null,\"runtime_group_id\":\"01a17c00-9594-7717-9ada-84d4d47f514b\",\"runtime_id\":\"01a17c00-9946-7777-a517-c30afa6c88db\",\"is_archived\":false,\"started_at\":null,\"completed_at\":null,\"last_user_message_at\":\"2026-10-27T06:17:00.998326Z\",\"metadata\":{\"error\":null,\"suite\":\"walk\",\"commands\":true,\"agent_name\":\"scripted\",\"task_prompt\":\"Call the `echo` tool from the declared `hello-mcp` MCP server with the message `hello from the public MCP`. Write the echoed value exactly, with no quotes or additional formatting, to `/workspace/outputs/greeting.txt`. Then run `echo $WALK_MARKER` in the shell and reply in one short sentence.\\n\\n<<SCRIPT {\\\"reply\\\":\\\"Echoed the message through hello-mcp and wrote it to the outputs file.\\\",\\\"tools\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"hello-mcp_echo\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"message\\\":\\\"hello from the public MCP\\\"}},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"write\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"/workspace/outputs/greeting.txt\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Echo: hello from the public MCP\\\"}},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"bash\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"command\\\":\\\"echo $WALK_MARKER\\\"}}]}>>\",\"active_run_id\":\"01a17c01-4743-73ca-ae8b-97d3a72b3c09\",\"latest_run_id\":\"01a17c01-4743-73ca-ae8b-97d3a72b3c09\",\"crash_restarts\":null,\"history_recall\":null,\"conversation_id